00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.560
So Survivorship Today is a program about

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:37.350
how people are living
long-term with cancer.

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:39.330
I got involved in this particular program

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:40.490
because in 2004,

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:43.460
my uncle, Sonny, passed away six months

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:46.294
from the day of his
diagnosis from cancer. Okay.

00:04:46.294 --> 00:04:47.130
- Wow.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:48.650
- Devastating thing for my family.

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:52.600
And so what can I do to sort
of like, you know, lift some,

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.230
bring some attention to the
cancer world and survivorship.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.050
The good thing is people
are living longer,

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:58.340
but just because you're living longer,

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.560
doesn't mean your life goes
