00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:01.855
- [Kelly] The quality, yeah.

00:05:01.855 --> 00:05:02.688
- Exactly.

00:05:02.688 --> 00:05:04.440
So there is a series of conversations

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:06.068
that are available on the websites,

00:05:06.068 --> 00:05:07.450
survivorshiptoday.com

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.630
where you can see people
