00:05:18.137 --> 00:05:21.380
and how devastating it
is when we are deprived

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.130
- Yeah and isolated. Yeah.
- Of community.

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:23.963
- You know what I'm saying?

00:05:23.963 --> 00:05:25.340
So if you feeling that intense isolation

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:26.550
that you can by going through something

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:27.980
