00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.440
he's a survivor of lung cancer.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.680
So, hey A.J.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:48.018
- [A.J.] Hi, Kelly.

00:05:48.018 --> 00:05:49.490
- Come on, you can stand up.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.880
(crowd cheers)

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.027
- [Sterling] My man.

00:05:52.027 --> 00:05:53.750
- [Kelly] So can you tell us a little

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.760
of your survivorship like story?

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:57.210
- [A.J.] Sure, absolutely.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.730
After two years of struggling

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:03.200
with going from doctor to doctor,

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.550
not knowing what's wrong with me,

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.150
just a hissing sound.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.950
I was eventually given the devastating,

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.930
most devastating news.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.713
I have stage four lung cancer.

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.390
Still emotional today

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.443
because I was told,

00:06:16.456 --> 00:06:18.880
'you won't probably
see beyond six months,'

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:20.040
just like Uncle Sonny.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:20.873
- Yeah.

00:06:20.873 --> 00:06:23.870
- And it ripped everything out of me.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:28.131
And today that was eight
and a half years ago.

00:06:28.131 --> 00:06:28.964
I was told,

00:06:28.964 --> 00:06:31.330
(crowd cheers)

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:33.559
- Thank you. Thank you.

00:06:33.559 --> 00:06:35.307
I feel truly blessed,

00:06:35.307 --> 00:06:37.870
but what people don't understand is,

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.960
as my daughter will tell you,
I look like a supermodel.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.640
You know, everything is great.

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:44.380
But in reality,

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.410
I go through a lot of psychological

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:49.680
and emotional struggles on a daily basis,

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.760
just unbuttoning my shirt,
impossible, impossible.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.330
I had to have brain surgery.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:56.820
I lost function on the
right side of the body.

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:59.000
This arm is a beautiful arm.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.580
Looks like a great prop on set,

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.670
but cannot do anything, it's useless.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:06.510
And so I cannot even unbutton my shirt.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:10.310
And so life is a struggle on a daily basis

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:12.730
and I'm emotionally challenged.

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:16.950
Every single day, I am told by
all the decoration around me,

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.410
you have cancer,

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.520
you will not survive very long.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:23.560
And what survivorship
today has allowed me to do

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:26.900
is to realize to live in this moment,

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:30.660
to live in this present being that I am,

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:34.880
and recognizing just how
beautiful my existence is.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:37.240
The beauty of everybody
that's surrounding me,

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.720
the beauty of the world.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.730
And I live moment to moment.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.680
And that's the beauty of this program.

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:44.050
For me personally,

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:45.720
I am so truly blessed

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:47.610
from six months to eight and a half years,

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:48.950
you think it's a miracle,

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:51.655
but at a bigger miracle
for me is my family.

00:07:51.655 --> 00:07:54.990
My family had been me
behind me from day one,

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.580
picking up offerings
when I couldn't get up.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:59.900
And it's so humbling to know

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:02.570
that a wife will stand right by you

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:05.850
at the time of your worst nightmare.

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:08.540
And my children, who were
only very little at the time,

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:11.610
have grown up to become future doctors

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.900
who want to make a difference
